## 7. Experimental Framework: AttractorBench

A benchmark suite for attractor-level AGI safety:

- Train small RNNs/transformers with controllable attractor landscapes.
- Inject safe and unsafe attractors.
- Measure reachability, viability margins, convergence times.
- Test CBF-CLF, HJ, and MPC controllers.
- Evaluate sample complexity of attractor identification from partial observations.

Metrics: reachable unsafe attractors, viability margin, convergence time, sample complexity.

